Viva Questions
What is a Validation Rule?

A validation rule checks data before saving records.

Why use Picklist for Department?

To restrict user input to predefined values.

What does TODAY() do?

It returns the current system date.

What is the use of Unique field?

It prevents duplicate Employee IDs.
